427 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 83 0 R
/T (Final decision: MODIFY the original design. Retain UCS as the route-cost optimizer, but do not use it from an assumed single start location after localization failure. First maintain and reduce the belief state using safe local sensing; then execute a conditional UCS route. This is safer and avoids blindly committing to a route that is valid for only one of the possible junctions.)
/E (Final decision: MODIFY the original design. Retain UCS as the route-cost optimizer, but do not use it from an assumed single start location after localization failure. First maintain and reduce the belief state using safe local sensing; then execute a conditional UCS route. This is safer and avoids blindly committing to a route that is valid for only one of the possible junctions.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
