430 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 83 0 R
/T (The original design should be modified rather than discarded: retain UCS for cost-aware movement after localization, but add a belief-state layer and local sensing. A sensor observation partitions the belief set into smaller subsets. If the local sensor identifies the current junction exactly, the belief state becomes a singleton and the original single-location planner can be applied from that location.)
/E (The original design should be modified rather than discarded: retain UCS for cost-aware movement after localization, but add a belief-state layer and local sensing. A sensor observation partitions the belief set into smaller subsets. If the local sensor identifies the current junction exactly, the belief state becomes a singleton and the original single-location planner can be applied from that location.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
