432 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 83 0 R
/T (To make the effect measurable, a small abstract test model is used. There are k possible leaf junctions. Each leaf has its own safe command that reaches the pharmacy docking point; a command intended for a different leaf is not guaranteed safe. Without a local sensor, no single first command is valid for all k candidates, so a guaranteed open-loop plan cannot be formed. With a perfect local sensor, the observation identifies the leaf and the robot follows the matching one-move route. Plan length counts one sensing step plus one movement step.)
/E (To make the effect measurable, a small abstract test model is used. There are k possible leaf junctions. Each leaf has its own safe command that reaches the pharmacy docking point; a command intended for a different leaf is not guaranteed safe. Without a local sensor, no single first command is valid for all k candidates, so a guaranteed open-loop plan cannot be formed. With a perfect local sensor, the observation identifies the leaf and the robot follows the matching one-move route. Plan length counts one sensing step plus one movement step.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [10]
>>
