1035 0 obj
<<
/Title (The basic operation is the repeated work that most strongly determines the search cost. For BFS and DFS, it is examining a graph edge / generating a successor and checking whether the neighbor has already been visited. For UCS, it is the relaxation of an edge \(calculating a new path cost and comparing it with the best known cost\); priority-queue insertion and removal also contribute logarithmic overhead.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1031 0 R
