/Title (I recommend Uniform-Cost Search as the primary route planner for the stated weighted hospital graph. The performance measure includes travel time, and the edges have different non-negative costs. BFS minimizes the number of edges, which may choose a route with more travel time. DFS can find a route but offers no optimality guarantee. UCS expands locations in increasing accumulated travel cost and therefore returns a minimum-cost route under the stated assumptions.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1116 0 R
/Next 1141 0 R
>>
